      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-03-20T04:36:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>No, \"The Whole Gang\" would be destroyed by that point. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Have you confirmed this? &nbsp;The wording on The Whole Gang is \" &nbsp;you may destroy a Target with 4 or fewer HP. Then, destroy this card.\" &nbsp;To me, that reads that the Demon's ability will interrupt the Bounty's before it destroys itself. &nbsp;But as I said before, triggers in SotM confuse me.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
